   306	    - Launch a ray from the source straight inward, perpendicular to the border, and color every traversed black cell with the source color.
   307	    - When the ray reaches a two-opening gray piece through one opening, fill every black cell inside that piece with the source color, then continue from the other opening in that opening's outward normal direction.
